# Summary of changes for run 770637bf-d4dc-4aa7-b077-c20ecd08c04a
Built a self-contained, fully-proved chain of results modelling a mathematical "phase transition" in the tropical (max-plus) setting, in the domain requested (Tropical), following the Builder mandate of a chain where each theorem uses the previous ones.

New file `Tropical/TropicalPhaseTransition.lean` develops the tropical order parameter `order κ c x = max(κ·(x−c), 0)` — the tropical binomial whose single breakpoint at `x = c` is the phase transition — and proves 14 theorems, with no `sorry` and axioms limited to `propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`:

- `order_nonneg` — nonnegativity;
- `order_eq_zero_of_le` — the incoherent (sub-critical) phase vanishes below `c`;
- `order_eq_of_ge`, `order_at_critical` — the linear law and critical value;
- `order_pos_of_lt`, `order_strictMonoOn_above` — strict positivity and strict growth in the coherent phase;
- `order_mono` — monotonicity in connectivity;
- `affine_convexOn` and the capstone `order_convexOn` — convexity of the order parameter (a tropical polynomial as a max of affine functions), the signature of a continuous/second-order transition;
- `order_lipschitz` — an explicit `|κ|`-Lipschitz bound;
- `phase_transition` — the qualitative dichotomy (identically zero at/below `c`, strictly positive above `c`);
- `numberTheory_inactive`/`numberTheory_active` — specialisations at a fixed model threshold.

The file compiles independently (verified with `lake build Tropical.TropicalPhaseTransition`), contains no trivial or circular proofs, and is deliberately distinct from the existing `Physics/MathematicsPhaseTransition.lean` (which uses a √ order parameter) while anchoring to the same theme.

Also added, in `Tropical/`: `ComputationalEvidence.md` (small-case tables, kink/convexity and Lipschitz sanity checks, a counterexample showing the `κ ≥ 0` hypothesis is necessary), `FUTURE_DIRECTIONS.md`, and the required `quality_score.json` with an honest self-evaluation (overall 0.5: the convexity, Lipschitz, and dichotomy results are non-trivial, while several supporting lemmas are elementary; the speculative framing is interpretive and labelled as such).

All work is committed and pushed to `origin`.
